WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.482
KMeans on Apple

00:00:01.293 --> 00:00:02.012
silicon

00:00:02.060 --> 00:00:03.133
twenty to thirty-one

00:00:02.944 --> 00:00:03.982
times faster

00:00:04.518 --> 00:00:06.841
mlx-learn 0.1.6 is

00:00:06.652 --> 00:00:07.112
out

00:00:07.218 --> 00:00:08.303
and its KMeans

00:00:08.115 --> 00:00:08.963
with the default

00:00:08.775 --> 00:00:10.826
k-means-plus-plus initialization

00:00:10.638 --> 00:00:11.699
now fits twenty

00:00:11.511 --> 00:00:12.701
to thirty-one times

00:00:12.513 --> 00:00:13.645
faster on Apple

00:00:13.457 --> 00:00:14.199
silicon

00:00:14.734 --> 00:00:15.712
On an M4

00:00:15.524 --> 00:00:16.125
Max

00:00:16.243 --> 00:00:19.002
fitting 8,192 centers

00:00:18.814 --> 00:00:19.981
on MNIST took

00:00:19.793 --> 00:00:23.672
219 seconds in version 0.1.5

00:00:23.791 --> 00:00:25.417
and just 7 seconds

00:00:25.265 --> 00:00:27.245
in 0.1.6

00:00:27.782 --> 00:00:29.244
Nothing else changed

00:00:29.386 --> 00:00:30.388
the same starting

00:00:30.199 --> 00:00:31.520
centers as scikit-learn

00:00:31.685 --> 00:00:33.041
the same iterations

00:00:33.053 --> 00:00:33.902
and the same

00:00:33.714 --> 00:00:34.409
inertia

00:00:34.527 --> 00:00:35.376
and the release

00:00:35.211 --> 00:00:36.095
is out now

00:00:36.630 --> 00:00:37.644
Full story on

00:00:37.455 --> 00:00:38.351
the dashboard
